VIDescription Line0002 = "ode on the DMTC and the DMTI will demonstrate the Dual Mode Thermometer XControl's functionality. The Fahrenheit Mode? b"
VIDescription Line0003 = "oolean is indicating whether the DMTI is in Fahrenheit mode by using a custom Property created for the DMT XControl. The"
VIDescription Line0004 = "  Converter converts Celcius to Fahrenheit using a Convert C to F method created for the DMT XControl.  Refer to the Pro"
